{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2024》將於今晚假將軍澳電視城舉行，作為TVB每年嘅盛事，一眾藝員歌手都會出盡渾身解數慶祝，除咗台慶嘅精彩內容外，事前嘅紅地毯環節同樣備受觀眾關注！以下將會為大家盤點今年台慶紅地毯嘅女星索爆造型，睇吓邊位更勝一籌！觀眾及評審投票選出的「myTV SUPER 2025 萬千星輝賀台慶...</p>\n\n每年11月19日都係TVB台慶日子，作為TVB每年嘅盛事，一眾藝員歌手都會出盡渾身解數慶祝，除咗台慶嘅精彩內容外，事前嘅紅地毯環節同樣備受觀眾關注！以下將會為大家回顧2025年台慶紅地毯嘅女星索爆造型，睇吓邊位來到2026年會更加搏命爭出位！<a></a>\n<h2>回顧台慶2025目錄</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a>回顧台慶2025紅地毯｜戴祖儀性感派福利上下都露！</a></li>\n<li><a>葉蒨文GM情侶檔登場</a></li>\n<li><a>陳煒大方得體當晚奪壓軸大獎！</a></li>\n<li><a>高海寧黃袍加身</a></li>\n<li><a>劉穎鏇閃亮登場</a></li>\n<li><a>「東張女神」齊齊現身</a></li>\n<li><a>TVB台慶2025｜應屆港姐齊上陣</a></li>\n<li><a>TVB台慶2025｜上屆港姐性感登場</a></li>\n<li><a>TVB台慶2025|林鈺洧奇「蕉」上陣</a></li>\n<li><a>TVB台慶2025|黃嘉雯高衩、大露背於一身</a></li>\n<li><a>TVB台慶2025 | 波波谷胸撼贏郭珮文</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<p>上屆「台慶之夜」一眾小花行紅地氈，猶記得戴祖儀戰鬥格大晒冷，加上一身超低胸剪裁，姣好身材一覽無遺，高開衩晚裝，走光邊緣徘徊。被安排與戴祖儀一同出場的與郭柏妍坦言「怕凍」間接認輸。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903011_x_1712534543691da60eb419e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 戴祖儀（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903011_x_1712534543691da60eb419e.jpg\" width=\"732\"/></a><figcaption>戴祖儀（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cfd60056-6572-45b0-9133-bcb2b4e6510b_1465077425691da6ae75e4d-1024x1247.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 走光邊緣（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1169\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cfd60056-6572-45b0-9133-bcb2b4e6510b_1465077425691da6ae75e4d-1024x1247.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>走光邊緣（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/971bcfd5-8582-46d0-9e23-a21e99ca7697_1017336510691da8178fa78.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/971bcfd5-8582-46d0-9e23-a21e99ca7697_1017336510691da8178fa78.jpeg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ee5602da-e4eb-4578-93bc-c1c5bd0198a5_1557219628691da90834055.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"972\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ee5602da-e4eb-4578-93bc-c1c5bd0198a5_1557219628691da90834055.jpeg\" width=\"923\"/></a></p>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>葉蒨文GM情侶檔登場</h2>\n<p>去年因為《女神配對》跑出，葉蒨文透視deepV上陣，拖住男友GM曾展望登場，隔離何沛珈全銀上陣，「電燈膽」閃到爆。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/355d5421-874e-4e03-ae9e-c7d1fa826c0a_1505894565691d9dd7dcb55.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 葉蒨文、何沛珈（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1057\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/355d5421-874e-4e03-ae9e-c7d1fa826c0a_1505894565691d9dd7dcb55.jpeg\" width=\"1020\"/></a><figcaption>葉蒨文、何沛珈（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ca268870-5019-49bf-8870-aa688669a8ad_1542628022691d9dd9743b5-1024x1004.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 曾展望、葉蒨文（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ca268870-5019-49bf-8870-aa688669a8ad_1542628022691d9dd9743b5-1024x1004.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾展望、葉蒨文（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/469b6e6e-4493-428b-8f02-6ad181794f31_1753533631691d9ddb0c072.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 曾展望、葉蒨文（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1050\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/469b6e6e-4493-428b-8f02-6ad181794f31_1753533631691d9ddb0c072.jpeg\" width=\"928\"/></a><figcaption>曾展望、葉蒨文（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>陳煒大方得體當晚奪壓軸大獎！</h2>\n<p>喜迎51歲生日嘅陳煒全場最靚！白色閃靈靈晚裝上陣，deepV到肚臍前後都露，性感得來大方得體！去年呢個晚上煒哥仲得到壓軸大奬，贏獎金又贏民心！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903022_y_26256762691da9d26ca32-1024x879.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 陳煒（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"824\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903022_y_26256762691da9d26ca32-1024x879.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳煒（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903025_y_123676610691daa32d8a6e-1024x864.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 後日51歲生日嘅陳煒全場最靚！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"810\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903025_y_123676610691daa32d8a6e-1024x864.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>後日51歲生日嘅陳煒全場最靚！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903024_x_1597111356691daa34a1159.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903024_x_1597111356691daa34a1159.jpg\" width=\"734\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903023_x_1345417853691daa36c0b05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903023_x_1345417853691daa36c0b05.jpg\" width=\"738\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>高海寧黃袍加身</h2>\n<p>紅地毯上壓軸登場的高海寧，黃袍加身僅露香肩與玉背！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903030_x_1774048899691dabb0ccbf2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 高海寧（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903030_x_1774048899691dabb0ccbf2.jpg\" width=\"757\"/></a><figcaption>高海寧（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903029_x_1786056248691dabb1a3d46.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 壓軸登場黃袍加身（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"774\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903029_x_1786056248691dabb1a3d46.jpg\" width=\"800\"/></a><figcaption>壓軸登場黃袍加身（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇閃亮登場</h2>\n<p>劉穎鏇身穿單肩黑色閃閃晚裝，露腰又露腿，大方得體！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903021_x_83736048691da9d446ae6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 劉穎鏇（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903021_x_83736048691da9d446ae6.jpg\" width=\"660\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>「東張女神」齊齊現身</h2>\n<p>「貓仔」黎寬怡=着咗件神秘灰黑色深V晚裝，背脊位置仲加咗對巨型黑色羽毛翅膀，行兩步就震一震，霸氣得似暗黑天使降臨，俞可程與廖倬竩企晒C位吸盡鎂光燈！俞可程一身純白低胸長裙，雪白肌膚加事業線若隱若現；廖倬竩就換上粉紅色貼身禮服，胸前同腰線位一樣咁進取！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183703_c23ac8ca96771a23b8add120a93275ae414fef1d_1098277617691da1796fc64-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 陳庭欣、鄧凱文、黎寬怡等東張女神（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183703_c23ac8ca96771a23b8add120a93275ae414fef1d_1098277617691da1796fc64-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳庭欣、鄧凱文、黎寬怡等東張女神（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183705_7b9c90b5160f400e54f88fc0f6c9664176c890d2_2047802412691da177a73d4-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 陳庭欣、鄧凱文、黎寬怡等東張女神（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183705_7b9c90b5160f400e54f88fc0f6c9664176c890d2_2047802412691da177a73d4-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳庭欣、鄧凱文、黎寬怡等東張女神（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183713_aafe4cb913521f27d3e3076a2d447456399d4cfc_1136560765691da175adf20-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 陳庭欣、鄧凱文、黎寬怡等東張女神（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183713_aafe4cb913521f27d3e3076a2d447456399d4cfc_1136560765691da175adf20-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳庭欣、鄧凱文、黎寬怡等東張女神（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183915_02ec41be18fd9dd63f489b01ce5f6d196fe468c6_1757705602691da1739982d-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 陳庭