.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903005_y_318923803691da611828c7-1024x957.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903008_x_759574119691da61014c9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"744\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/photo_6118619300923903008_x_759574119691da61014c9c.jpg\" width=\"800\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>TVB台慶2025｜應屆港姐齊上陣</h2>\n<p>2025應屆港姐冠軍陳詠詩，亞軍施宇琪，季軍袁文靜以及「友誼小姐」李尹嫣齊上陣，色彩斑斕的晚裝狀態極佳！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2236_1157743263691d987c5d5b9-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 2025港姐上陣（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2236_1157743263691d987c5d5b9-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2025港姐上陣（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2220_611667630691d988360761-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2220_611667630691d988360761-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2204_1174580320691d9885cdc24-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2204_1174580320691d9885cdc24-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>TVB台慶2025｜上屆港姐性感登場</h2>\n<p>雖然當日氣溫急降，但無阻一眾女星性感上陣，2024年港姐冠軍倪樂琳，亞軍梁嘉瑩，季軍楊梓瑤，銀色tone上陣，梁嘉瑩大方展示美腿相當吸睛！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2351_147369668691d9b7baea36-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2351_147369668691d9b7baea36-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2448_700224950691d9b7e17c8a-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2448_700224950691d9b7e17c8a-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2438_1257404952691d9b8013032-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2438_1257404952691d9b8013032-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2433_1513056608691d9b8280211-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2433_1513056608691d9b8280211-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>TVB台慶2025|林鈺洧奇「蕉」上陣</h2>\n<p>宋宛穎、林鈺洧、黃嘉雯三大港姐冠軍登場，林鈺洧瞬間成「蕉」點！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/07dd87c0-9760-4b89-913c-0882557ee2e0_415075578691d9d2004b4f-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/07dd87c0-9760-4b89-913c-0882557ee2e0_415075578691d9d2004b4f-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<p>黃嘉雯的銀色晚裝可以話係集低胸、高衩、大露背於一身，從側面望過去，睇到都面紅！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2615_1109693503691d9d2266a3e-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2615_1109693503691d9d2266a3e-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2608_1392071968691d9d24d2ce1-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2608_1392071968691d9d24d2ce1-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2606_356560258691d9d2751a96-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2606_356560258691d9d2751a96-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2605_1001240578691d9d2989fce-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/vs-youtube-2605_1001240578691d9d2989fce-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<p>前幾日在社交平台問著咩嘅波波，心口成眾人焦點，成功撼贏「新咪神」郭珮文。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/c7f4149d-a1be-4199-9a13-af8c3fe849b8_154646697691d9dd6e1147.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 波波（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/c7f4149d-a1be-4199-9a13-af8c3fe849b8_154646697691d9dd6e1147.jpeg\" width=\"631\"/></a><figcaption>波波（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183104_c3f59ddf8ded609edfee293c16a090bde3b57820_1212734019691d9ff2923c8-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2025｜一文睇清紅地毯索爆造型 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20251119183104_c3f59ddf8ded609edfee293c16a090bde3b57820_1212734019691d9ff2923c8-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<br/><a>回到目錄</a> <br/>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:44:16.496904+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2464,"images":56,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:33:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:29.177598+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:37:22.077792+00:00","content_hash":"45b4d71bb0fc0f1b8ac58d39d61c699106c892054c627b275894aaee7f5a7b09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}